{"id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-borel-set.md","title":"Borel Set","display":"df-borel-set — Borel Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-borel-set","aliases":["58-df-borel-set","Borel Set"],"display":"df-borel-set — Borel Set","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[./58-df-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-borel-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-borel-set</span><span>Borel Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-borel-set — Borel Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"./58-df-topology.md\">58-df-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal T,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal T,B\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"./58-df-topology.md\">58-df-topology.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X:V\\to V\">\\(\\sigma_X:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land B\\in\\sigma_X(\\mathcal T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land B\\in\\sigma_X(\\mathcal T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Borel: sigma-algebra generated by open sets</li>\n<li>The generated algebra is used as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\sigma_X(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>; no global symbol with hidden free parameters <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal T\">\\(X,\\mathcal T\\)</span> is introduced.</li>\n<li>Contains all open and closed sets, countable unions/intersections</li>\n<li>Smaller than Lebesgue measurable in general</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^n)\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^n)\\)</span> is separable, countably generated</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Billingsley, Probability and Measure</li>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,\\mathcal T,B\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)$ (see [[./58-df-topology.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2$ and $\\sigma_X:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal T,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_X:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\mathcal T,X)\\land B\\in\\sigma_X(\\mathcal T)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma_X(\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^n)","display":false}],"bytes":1167,"backlinks":[{"id":"8c2636b7f029a7c9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ and $\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\in V$ are from [[58-df-borel-set]]"},{"id":"d7ddfbdf0ee2d47d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}_S$（三元 Borel 集谓词，见 [[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]]）"},{"id":"266bdc015ee47b22","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}_S\\subseteq V^3$ is the Borel-set predicate (see [[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]])"},{"id":"e36ff0da02f94e7a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9d6520eb2e68d23c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md|58-df-borel-set]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a740bdad87b97ac6","e7514bc4cefba4f2"]}